        "description": "<p>Quickly reorder your WooCommerce products by category with a simple drag-and-drop interface.<br />\nHelp available directly in the plugin. Support: alo@alotrendmarketing.com</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the /wp-content/plugins/alodev-product-reorder-by-category directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to Products / Reorder Products to reorder your products.</li>\n</ol>\n"
